 #: src/menus/select/shrink.xml:61(para)
 msgid ""
 "This option is only of interest if the selection runs along the edge of the "
-"image. If it does and this option is not checked, then the selection shrinks "
-"away from the edge of the image. If this option is checked, the selection "
+"image. If it does and this option is not checked, then the selection shrinks"
+" away from the edge of the image. If this option is checked, the selection "
 "continues to extend to the image border. See <xref linkend=\"selection-"
 "outside\"/>."
 msgstr ""
+"Det här alternativet är bara relevant om markeringen följer bildens kant. Om"
